      "content": "thanks but it's not that simple. people only respect you when you're winning. once the money is gone and the house is gone and everyone sees you've failed... there's nothing left to save. it's just the humiliation. the slow, agonizing crawl to the bottom where everyone is looking at you with pity. i just want the descent to stop.",
